#
# ✒ Description:
#     agent-watch is LF throughout. Text is stored and checked out as LF
#     whatever a machine's core.autocrlf says, so a checkout on Windows
#     never rewrites a file's endings; binaries are left as they are.
#
# ✒ Key Features:
#     - Text stored and checked out as LF on every machine
#     - Windows batch files check out as CRLF, which cmd.exe needs
#     - Images and fonts marked binary, never converted or diffed as text
#     - The logo's SVGs stay text, so their edits can be read in a diff
#
# ✒ Other Important Information:
#     - Dependencies: git.
#     - Compatible platforms: any git client.
#     - Later lines win: the specific rules must stay below the * line.
# ---------
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
